within-bifolium quintile contrast (lowest minus highest component-diversity fifth) of three outcomes: the study word impact (twins
anywhere in the 100-token windows), repeat outside cone (a twin within 99 tokens not in the cone), repeat outside cone and line (also
not on N's line). Manuscript rows: 95% bifolium-resampling intervals; copier rows: mean over seeds [min, max].

